{"1841160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Amata", "steam_appid": 1841160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Entering 1.0 August 20th!!</h1><p>I am thrilled to announce that Amata will be entering into 1.0 on August 20th! Thank you everyone so much!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The path of broken stone is ended. The incursion of Amata is ended. Charlet must now escape from The Memetic Expanse, where Amata was formed, found and ended. Though Amata is gone its power remains. Its agents are never ending. Charlet is never ending. Amata is a (mostly) linear fantasy 2D side scrolling action RPG platformer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/extras/3e6a3e39f10696c61f9d9c4c84e0356d.poster.avif?t=1787230366\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/extras/3e6a3e39f10696c61f9d9c4c84e0356d.webm?t=1787230366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/extras/3e6a3e39f10696c61f9d9c4c84e0356d.mp4?t=1787230366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Traverse vast and varied worlds with smooth, fluid and dynamic movement mechanics. An agent should have grace.<br></li><li> Cut down enemies using the Memetic Blade, unbind them from their experience. An agent should seek knowing.<br></li><li> Deftly block and parry enemy attacks. An agent should protect their self.<br></li><li> Wear, wield and consume magical artifacts, items and charms. An agent should have options.<br></li><li> Apply unbound experience to a suite of stats. An agent should choose their self.<br></li><li> Move instantly between all known realms and checkpoints. An agent should feel freedom.<br></li><li> Collect realm memories from the arcane contrivance of Amata. An agent should seek bounty.<br></li><li> Unlock new realms, fight new foes, solve new puzzles, devise new routes. An agent should cut deep into the marrow.<br></li><li> See the impact of Amata within its most ancient lands. An agent should use the past to inform the future.<br></li><li> Endure your cybertronic companion, IAIA, and ignore its interjections. An agent should be wary of the wise.<br></li><li> Try to forget about the path of broken stone. An agent should know what is ended.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "The path of broken stone is ended. The incursion of Amata is ended. Charlet must now escape from The Memetic Expanse, where Amata was formed, found and ended. Though Amata is gone its power remains. Its agents are never ending. Charlet is never ending. Amata is a (mostly) linear fantasy 2D side scrolling action RPG platformer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/extras/3e6a3e39f10696c61f9d9c4c84e0356d.poster.avif?t=1787230366\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/extras/3e6a3e39f10696c61f9d9c4c84e0356d.webm?t=1787230366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/extras/3e6a3e39f10696c61f9d9c4c84e0356d.mp4?t=1787230366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Traverse vast and varied worlds with smooth, fluid and dynamic movement mechanics. An agent should have grace.<br></li><li> Cut down enemies using the Memetic Blade, unbind them from their experience. An agent should seek knowing.<br></li><li> Deftly block and parry enemy attacks. An agent should protect their self.<br></li><li> Wear, wield and consume magical artifacts, items and charms. An agent should have options.<br></li><li> Apply unbound experience to a suite of stats. An agent should choose their self.<br></li><li> Move instantly between all known realms and checkpoints. An agent should feel freedom.<br></li><li> Collect realm memories from the arcane contrivance of Amata. An agent should seek bounty.<br></li><li> Unlock new realms, fight new foes, solve new puzzles, devise new routes. An agent should cut deep into the marrow.<br></li><li> See the impact of Amata within its most ancient lands. An agent should use the past to inform the future.<br></li><li> Endure your cybertronic companion, IAIA, and ignore its interjections. An agent should be wary of the wise.<br></li><li> Try to forget about the path of broken stone. An agent should know what is ended.</li></ul>", "short_description": "Rage across the mad realms of a dead god as Charlet, the immortal artificer. Explore a vast, arcane desolation wrought by hatred. Cleanse the twisted inhabitants of ancient, forgotten worlds. Help Charlet find a way home using her powerful and varied suite of combat and platforming abilities.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/d0ffa8a47d3958cc35814a86333a9ec02a5faca0/header.jpg?t=1787230366", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/ccf38149ea3e5b70e9343363281f88f3d861221e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787230366", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841160/ccf38149ea3e5b70e9343363281f88f3d861221e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787230366", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel® Core™ i3-2105<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ R7 Graphics / Intel® HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</